# Trusted keys directory
# Release-signing PUBLIC keys live here as <keyId>.pem (SPKI PEM).
# This placeholder keeps the directory present (and the API Dockerfile COPY
# valid) before any key is provisioned. An empty directory = trust nothing =
# every release rejected (fail closed). Remove this file once a real key
# (e.g. clovaforge-release-1.pem) is added.
